sequenceDiagram
    actor Sl as Seller applicant
    participant App as Desi Bazaar app
    participant A as Admin
    Sl->>App: Submit application (ID photo, private/trader status)
    App->>App: State → Pending (cannot list)
    App->>A: Queue for verification
    A->>A: Versioned checklist: evidence, checks, decision, reviewer, date
    alt Approved
        A->>App: Approve
        App->>Sl: Verified badge (scope + date, no product guarantee)
    else Rejected
        A->>App: Reject with reason
        App->>Sl: Reason given — one re-apply allowed
    end
